libmidas for Debian
-------------------

The orig tarball already contains the autotools files regenerated with
"autoreconf -ivf" (LT_INIT added to configure.ac). They are regenerated again
at build time by dh_autoreconf, with "automake --foreign" because upstream
does not ship NEWS, AUTHORS and ChangeLog.

The NASM x86 mixing routines are disabled (--disable-nasm): the C mixer is
used on every architecture.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

